</span>  <span>1 min read</span>
<a href="/series/c-notes/" class="meta-link text-ink-2">c-notes</a><a href="/tags/life/" class="meta-link text-ink-2">#life</a><a href="/tags/draft/" class="meta-link text-ink-2">#draft</a></p>    <article class="prose-panel mt-10" data-copy-code data-reveal>
